{"posts":[{"id":"art_p12_276","t":"Small update. Have been away from journal but not from trading. Only being in silence one can start to grasp who one is. Journal was too much of a distraction.\n\nNot sure how to sum up what silence taught but something with in those lines: Less is more.\n\nWill share 1 trade:","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#276","p":12,"im":["955ed4ea3b6770fa69b0680907c8f7a865f1fe38"],"m":276},{"id":"art_p12_277","t":"Partial close on GJ. Let's see if it goes lower.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#277","p":12,"im":["f03025b61db20b255d12415b08c164fa0e0ac18a"],"m":277},{"id":"art_p12_278","t":"GJ reminder was stopped out. Overall +0,5R","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#278","p":12,"im":[],"m":278},{"id":"art_p12_279","t":"NZDUSD short. closed some. Targeting those lows on the chart.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#279","p":12,"im":["8a438559e7d18b0bf2e1ea1d0c1f4716dae350ff"],"m":279},{"id":"art_p12_280","t":"Closed some more. Final TG remains the same.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#280","p":12,"im":["db7d1d6ff61c6f6b04765da210d94db1e3933ac3"],"m":280},{"id":"art_p12_281","t":"Later today FOMC meeting, FED fund rate and important NZD news. So I'll stay out of the way","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#281","p":12,"im":[],"m":281},{"id":"art_p12_282","t":"NZDUSD Final TP hit.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#282","p":12,"im":["6b7b1669f149f403c904a9e3080e092e0dfcbf20"],"m":282},{"id":"art_p12_283","t":"EJ short worked out.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#283","p":12,"im":["bf82b345d65dbac8a04c9ff168bb63fd33f42adb"],"m":283},{"id":"art_p12_284","t":"Art wrote: EJ short worked out.\n\nCongrats on the result of the trade. I wondered what your reasoning was and studied the M15 (though I can not trade that timeframe):\n\nIs something like this what your analysis was?","a":"PivO","d":"","n":"#284","p":12,"im":["bf82b345d65dbac8a04c9ff168bb63fd33f42adb","a42ef170d64b7eea60c8e3461391dc91974bfd6c"],"m":284},{"id":"art_p12_285","t":"Yes","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#285","p":12,"im":[],"m":285},{"id":"art_p12_286","t":"Though it is not always one can enjoy good trades. AUDCAD was a quick loss. Got lost in lower timeframes and missed forest for the trees.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#286","p":12,"im":["c31d4e92f91ade06d73dd0ac63852c6830f9db67"],"m":286},{"id":"art_p12_287","t":"Closed EURUSD partial. Risk free now.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#287","p":12,"im":["624dfc3584abc824d0a4c8ad7d99008e0f742db5"],"m":287},{"id":"art_p12_288","t":"Art wrote: Closed EURUSD partial. Risk free now.\n\nAre you able to trade the lower time frames?","a":"PivO","d":"","n":"#288","p":12,"im":["624dfc3584abc824d0a4c8ad7d99008e0f742db5"],"m":288},{"id":"art_p12_289","t":"Not often. When I have enough time and enough patience","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#289","p":12,"im":[],"m":289},{"id":"art_p12_290","t":"Humo Sapiens is a strange creature. So I have this EURUSD open. Partial was closed. It is risk free, actually some +0.3R locked in no matter what now. Though EURUSD is moving against me now and I sweat, like mind creates this endless stream of bad scenarios!\n\nIt is funny and sad at the same time","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#290","p":12,"im":["ea1f5de7d7866ab24a78d7708658f69a345eaf82"],"m":290},{"id":"art_p12_291","t":"short USDJPY with 4.2 pips SL. Entry at 123.169 SL at 123.211","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#291","p":12,"im":["32a0e9c0dca8a051bdd8ee141db34a83ef242254"],"m":291},{"id":"art_p12_292","t":"Final target hit on UJ.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#292","p":12,"im":["396845f606deee76db719ea92c43f30e85871b28"],"m":292},{"id":"art_p12_293","t":"4 trades today.\n\n#1\n\nAUDCAD M1 FTR short.\n\nClosed partial and it did not go lower. Outcome +0,3R. A good crack a a short.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#293","p":12,"im":["358e2d7c6c62c7d4fbc34aef9cc6f5ceea9a4824"],"m":293},{"id":"art_p12_294","t":"#2\n\nSecond attempt at AUDCAD short. This was was aggressive trade. Sweated a bit because it was out of my comfort zone. closed partial. Not sure yet will it be a great outcome or another +0.3 R.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#294","p":12,"im":["b7bce16471ef87d83595bbc0e856dd1172db5e7a"],"m":294},{"id":"art_p12_295","t":"AUDNZD Supply. for next 2 trades.\n\n#3\n\nFound FTR in that H4 supply. Set Limit order. Partial has not been closed yet. So there is some risk left.\n\nEntry:","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#295","p":12,"im":["40b45144e0cacc402298e5093b80440ec1c6ac8d","1589324637a93a7cbda06901ee5aee604ebd379a"],"m":295},{"id":"art_p12_296","t":"#4 was not planned but after limit sell was triggered it formed and seemd like worth adding another short position. So shorted... it went to TG1, intented to press ^Close partial^ but clicked ^ close whole position.^ So this was pretty lame!!! outcome: +1,3R\n\nSeems it was peanuts day!","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#296","p":12,"im":["44cdfcbc3a846bf8ffce84388cf6db252acf1242"],"m":296},{"id":"art_p12_297","t":"good entry bad management. Was too protective with SL on remainder. This thing has potential to make a decent drop. oh well... until the next one.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#297","p":12,"im":["9995f319f3f173dac124435f34aa62385ce1aebe"],"m":297},{"id":"art_p12_298","t":"So first AN gave +1,3R, second -0,3R.\n\nDear AUDNZD, it is not over YET! As long as you are in that supply I'm gonna hunt you!","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#298","p":12,"im":["c850952b1ddaf0e21355cd58937a28f714b3c254"],"m":298},{"id":"art_p12_299","t":"Art wrote: So first AN gave +1,3R, second -0,3R.\n\nDear AUDNZD, it is not over YET! As long as you are in that supply I'm gonna hunt you!\n\nI drew my supply level on H1. Not planning to start a discussion on right or wrong. I did not have a limit sell in place","a":"PivO","d":"","n":"#299","p":12,"im":["6fad4ad0224d959823c83b531e455f74f7fc38de"],"m":299},{"id":"art_p12_300","t":"Your supply has been revisited by that spike(FTB has happened). hence why would not consider it for a limit sell trade. Only for PA.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#300","p":12,"im":[],"m":300}],"images":[{"k":"955ed4ea3b6770fa69b0680907c8f7a865f1fe38","t":"assets/thumbs/955ed4ea3b6770fa69b0680907c8f7a865f1fe38.we